<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-020" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu-wyd" source-id="s-nanqishu-020-chulingqu-wyd">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu-wyd:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu-wyd:p001:m0000" ref="w4m_9tw_147_A">東昏</persName><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu-wyd:p001:m0002" ref="6fs_tis_zoa_AA">褚皇后</persName>名<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu-wyd:p001:m0006" ref="6fs_tis_zoa_AA">令璩</persName>河南陽翟人太常<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu-wyd:p001:m0015" ref="6fs_tis_zoa_A">澄</persName>女也建武二年納為皇太子妃明年謁<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu-wyd:p001:m0031" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6_A">敬后</persName>廟東昏即位為皇后帝寵<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu-wyd:p001:m0043" ref="gp4_61p_jwc">潘妃</persName>后不被遇<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu-wyd:p001:m0049" ref="nxr_ok6_sn7">黃淑儀</persName>生太子<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu-wyd:p001:m0055" ref="w4m_9tw_147_AA">誦</persName>東昏廢並為庶人</p>
</text>
